          warnSource: 'itel IP54 Hybrid Inverter User Guide, “Fault Code Table” and “Warning Code Table”, pp. 41-43 (customer-provided). The guide covers IPV-4K24U (4 kW, 24 V) and IPV-6K48U (6 kW, 48 V).',
